  "Question": "A person commutes \\(x\\) km each day. A private car emits 0.2 kg per kilometer, while a bus emits 0.05 kg per kilometer. To save at least 3 kg of emissions per day by switching to the bus, what is the minimum value of \\(x\\), in km?",
